{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-57","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Er will … haben","bn":"সে দাবি করে …"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er will den Chef gesehen haben.“ মানে কী?","options":["সে বসকে দেখতে চায়।","শোনা যায়, সে বসকে দেখেছে।","সে দাবি করে যে সে বসকে দেখেছে।"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-57-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie will die Arbeit schon ___ haben. (machen)","options":["gemacht","machen","macht"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wollen + Partizip II + haben।","id":"b1-practice-57-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ___ das Geld gefunden haben. (দাবি করে)","options":["wird","will","soll"],"answer":1,"explanation":"নিজের দাবি → wollen।","id":"b1-practice-57-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Restaurant ___ sehr gut sein. (শোনা যায়)","options":["will","wird","soll"],"answer":2,"explanation":"অন্যের কাছে শোনা কথা → sollen।","id":"b1-practice-57-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„sollen“ আর „wollen“ (এই অর্থে) পার্থক্য কী?","options":["sollen = অন্যরা বলে, wollen = সে নিজে দাবি করে","দুটো একই","sollen = সে নিজে দাবি করে, wollen = অন্যরা বলে"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-57-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Junge will die Hausaufgaben schon ___ haben.","options":["zu machen","gemacht","machen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-57-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er soll sehr reich sein.“ মানে কী?","options":["তার খুব ধনী হওয়া উচিত।","সে খুব ধনী হতে চায়।","শোনা যায়, সে খুব ধনী।"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-57-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Mein Nachbar will ein Gewitter gesehen haben. Glaubst du ___?","options":["ihm","ihn","er"],"answer":0,"explanation":"jemandem glauben → Dativ: ihm।","id":"b1-practice-57-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Kindheit“ মানে কী?","options":["জন্ম","শৈশব","যৌবন"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-57-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Generation“ মানে কী?","options":["বৈচিত্র্য","সংঘাত","প্রজন্ম"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-57-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„der Treffpunkt“ মানে কী?","options":["মিলনস্থল","বিনিময়","হাঁটার লাঠি"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-57-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ morgen früh aufstehen. (Futur)","options":["wurde","werde","würde"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-57-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Je mehr man arbeitet, ___ mehr Erfahrung hat man.","options":["als","so","desto"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-57-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe einen Antrag ___.","options":["gestellt","getroffen","geleistet"],"answer":0,"explanation":"einen Antrag stellen।","id":"b1-practice-57-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Mann, ___ ich gestern geholfen habe, wohnt bei seiner Tochter.","options":["der","dem","den"],"answer":1,"explanation":"helfen + Dativ → dem।","id":"b1-practice-57-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":35,"vocabulary":36}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-57","level":"B1","test":[]}